  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>검정말 현미경 관찰과 BTB용액 색 변화</p><p>실험이 간단하고 결과가 잘 나왔던것 같습니다.<br></p></div><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C26E415E4B4AFD01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"392\" height=\"458\" style=\"width: 392px; height: 458px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"김휘수,김병준.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99C26E415E4B4AFD01BEA4\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994F1D355E4B4B4614\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"292\" height=\"668\" style=\"width: 292px; height: 668px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"검정말-녹색BTB.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_994F1D355E4B4B4614A777\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99450E355E4B4B4807\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"299\" height=\"584\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 584px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"검정말-청색BTB.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_99450E355E4B4B4807E16F\"/><